    "name": "📌 Eden AI API",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"Access around 1,000 LLMs and expert AI models through one unified API.\"\n\nEden AI sends one request to models from many providers. It supports parallel requests to multiple providers, including OpenAI, Amazon, Anthropic, Google, Mistral and xAI. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Routers & aggregators**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- Eden AI Account: [https://app.edenai.run/](https://app.edenai.run/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `eden_ai_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:eden_ai_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.edenai.co/](https://docs.edenai.co/)\n    \n- Models: [https://app.edenai.run/bricks/catalog](https://app.edenai.run/bricks/catalog)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
